# Route: guide 38 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 56 to
# 57, 38 quests, 1.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Redridge Mountains, Western Plaguelands, Westfall): Lakeshire -> Three
# Corners -> Lakeshire -> Sorrow Hill -> Ruins of Andorhal -> Northridge
# Lumber Camp -> Sorrow Hill -> Thondroril River -> Lakeshire -> Lakeridge
# Highway -> Lakeshire -> Redridge Canyons -> Lakeshire -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Oh Brother... (167; Foreman
# Thistlenettle 20); Collecting Memories (168; Skeletal Miner 17-18, Undead
# Excavator 17-18, Undead Dynamiter 17-18).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): What Comes Around... (386), What Comes Around... (386),
# Songblade Search (95772), Songblade Search (95772), Barov Family Fortune
# (5343), Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the Herald
# (5384), The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors
# (5515), Of Love and Family (5848), The Defias Brotherhood (166), The Defias
# Brotherhood (166), The Unsent Letter (373).

